        "created_at": "2015-06-15T17:45:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Reverend Pete\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Reverend Pete:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>bluedarky wrote:</b><br>\n<blockquote>Spite Variant, Gloomweaver Variant, Nightmist Variant, Fanatic Variant, Visionary Variant, The Ennead.\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<p>I thought they did Redeemer Fanatic a couple of weeks back… maybe I was dreaming?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>They used her in the Apostate game, where i they wasted all their nukes on a combo that does nothing to protect itself and allow apostate to flip, while they had 2 sucker punches in hand</p>",
