        "created_at": "2015-06-15T20:31:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It would cause him to flip. &nbsp;If Apostate still has a relic in play on his front side he will destroy the relic and flip. &nbsp;It's only on his back side that you can sucker punch or use a similar ability to destroy him even if a relic is in play. &nbsp;I don't think it's in Spiff's FAQ but once migrantp lists the fireside chat for Infernal Relics it will be the official ruling.&nbsp;</p>",
